  "notes": "{剥|む}く means to peel or remove the outer layer of something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{剥|む}ける→剥ける：19379_mukeru⟧ (intransitive - to peel off, come off)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{皮|かわ}→皮：02187_kawa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{剥|む}く: to peel skin/rind\n- ⟦りんご→りんご：02269_ringo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{剥|む}く: to peel an apple\n- ⟦{卵|たまご}→卵：02222_tamago⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{殻|から}→殻：02148_kara⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{剥|む}く: to peel an egg shell\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{剥|む}く: to open eyes wide (in surprise)\n- ⟦{牙|きば}→牙：16154_kiba⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{剥|む}く: to bare one's fangs\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n- {剥|む}く: to peel\n- ⟦{向|む}く→向く：02304_muku⟧: to face, to turn toward",
